[{"client_msg_id":"54f2edd9-0c89-4a8d-a8da-f0016072712c","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"違いをうまく説明できるようになりたい・・・","ts":"1628491838.132100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rzA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93a0b5e8-cc6b-4688-80aa-1aeb410cb35e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一応初出ではないけど、レアですね。","ts":"1628491639.131700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S8x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"814836be-8619-4160-a298-98dca78c683f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go は、実装側が interface について考える必要がなく、必要になったら利用側を interface 依存に作り変えられるので、依存性逆転も「実装が複数出てきて必要になったらやればいいのでは」的気楽さがありますね","ts":"1628491576.131100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U023Z8L90BG"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1KcX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad7e078c-e3f1-435b-9728-bd49dd9cba6a","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"Goの考え方の方が特殊なんですかね、やっぱり・・・","ts":"1628491454.128900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tWwkL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"230b3a28-3d73-43a6-9575-4193fa1ede35","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"JavaのInterfaceのと意味合いは一緒ですよ。","ts":"1628491043.128400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4UWqs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67d066c5-6264-4915-8a54-8ab49e597c5a","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"pimpleパターン知らなかったというかC++自体知らないんですが、調べてみたら面白いですね。でもこれヘッダインクルードでコードがコピーされて展開されるC系言語特有のパターンですよね。これGoに持ち込む人いるんですね・・・。","ts":"1628490345.128000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oVi9P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33ee04a0-f6a3-4eea-8303-1fd0bfccf2c5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"C++のpimplパターンとかも、Javaの慣習と同じでGoでは邪魔なんだよなぁ。","ts":"1628489645.125900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rvu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5aeb394f-579b-49f5-8b90-693ff762a71b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"確かに素朴なテクニックで済むことは多いね。","ts":"1628489581.124700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UDcoI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f5f4d18-c87f-49a5-9cb6-5180d8a11cbf","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"Go導入で一番苦労するのはJavaの慣習を剥がすこと定期ですね・・・","ts":"1628489554.124100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U023Z8L90BG"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SRd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"830e1a3e-24ed-4e91-8004-87d5b9cafaab","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"どっちかというと依存関係逆転みたいな頑張って疎にするようなパターンで共通インターフェースを参照しているようなケースが目についたのでそれはおかしいなと思いまして。\nGoならそもそももうちょい素朴な実装で十分なケースが多いとは思います。","ts":"1628489516.123600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tbE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce614529-046e-482d-9551-ac3a01c85d6d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"DDDとかやって依存関係の逆転みたいなのがクリティカルになった時に、初めてDIとかテクニックが要るようになる。","ts":"1628489429.122400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"41Kcq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1945b8d-71d6-423f-a3ea-ca71fbbdc1dc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"無理に疎にする必要はない。","ts":"1628489365.121300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1NG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dbd3c4c-f468-4581-a8dc-2f777c4708b6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Goでは本当に依存するなら、パッケージの依存関係が書かれてるのは正しいのよ。","ts":"1628489332.120900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628489345.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h/Ikg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4867d1b8-f587-457a-8133-306c05604adc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ま、いっしょか","ts":"1628489226.119600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9jB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"738547ea-4a36-4df5-b762-eabc4acee39b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕はこのinterface満たします、っていうのを上に書いておくと、壊れた場合単体テストとかのコンパイル時に気が付くから。","ts":"1628489210.119400","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628489265.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MK=e6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de2706b8-d2dd-49ea-8a32-3e037edf54df","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"どうしてもやりたいときはテストパッケージ側に定義しておくとかですかね。","ts":"1628489181.118700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1CqDh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f78772b-6b5e-4935-9480-59456b9d559f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"お、なるほど","ts":"1628489164.118200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9eGe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b8a796b-fec7-4fff-a03b-ca596dbda335","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`var _ somepkg.InterfaceType = (MyType*)nil` みたいなの、MyType 側に書いておけばいいんやで。","ts":"1628489147.117700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LRV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7df2c78b-d327-4d3e-800a-5ac613e3c057","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"なるほど。でもこれだとDoerが別パッケージで定義されてた場合そのパッケージへの参照が発生してしまいますね。\n自分ならあまりこのやり方は取らないですね。全体のコンパイル時に気付ければいいので。","ts":"1628489121.117000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F4N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72931fd6-6dda-46fa-a014-b51ee1d