am":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6t52"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edd6c068-85f2-43ba-9ec7-762905d44a94","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"齟齬を起こさないために、定義時に気づくようにするテクニックもあります","ts":"1628488922.113800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"422W3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5068d6fa-0e27-451b-8f74-1e999267078f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"齟齬がおきたときに気付きにくそうだけど、まあ大丈夫か","ts":"1628488906.113500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tmYoh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33c83045-c057-4516-a63c-552f352112aa","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"Javaみたいにクラス定義時にインターフェースを実装していることを明示する\nのではなく、利用者がインターフェースをよしなに定義することが可能、なのが違いですね","ts":"1628488868.113000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X33A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ceecc246-3f1d-45f5-ba0f-c84cde164e43","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"ですね","ts":"1628488801.111900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=gWMp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8b66994-77ad-4e4c-afba-22173d8cf01a","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"多分ですけど、Rubyみたいな動的型付け言語でダックタイピングするイメージのほうが想像しやすいと思います","ts":"1628488791.111600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ksMB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64ED524C-4420-4F50-BC38-EB819481EE00","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ですです\nダックタイピングの利点","ts":"1628488773.111200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VpIn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4273698-f883-4054-83c7-2f6d19980083","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"実装で取り出すから、というのは？","ts":"1628488767.110800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LgsI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3166d21-ea87-4fd0-8092-0b303725b4c8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"実装で取り出すから...か\n実装内容で乖離してきたりはないのかな...ならいいか","ts":"1628488716.110200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fCU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05750bb2-980f-4394-a91a-2f5e4f2fc250","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"利点というか、必要ない依存性を作る必要ないですよね","ts":"1628488566.109200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EsImV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf4b0564-52cd-4ec3-a722-0bf96e795588","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"へえ、そうなんですね\nGoのプラクティスわかってないこともあってそのへんは知識がない..\nなんか利点あるのかな?","ts":"1628488398.108800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+BYAy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a2ed5e4-3c26-4ab0-bbe2-d0edaa83ae9b","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"スライド見て思ったんですが、他の言語（Javaとか）だとインターフェースを別パッケージに定義して共通化して、それをDIの注入先と注入元両方でインポートするような実装が多いと思うんですけど、Goだと別に共通で同じインターフェース定義を参照する必要ないですよね？\n注入先ではインターフェースを同じパッケージ内で定義して引数の型定義として指定すれば良くて、注入元は別にインターフェース型で作る必要もなく実装型でそのまま取り出せば良くて、引数として渡すときに注入先のインターフェースを満たしていれば良いので。\n\nなんか他言語のデザパタそのまま持ち込んだ設計を見てしまうことがちょいちょいあるので気になりまして。","ts":"1628488222.107800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CA7T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b230671-6e88-499c-9d79-ca8739b8f932","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"中身全くGo関係ないですね。Gopherくん可愛いので気持ちはわからなくもないですけどｗ","ts":"1628487314.100500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bSNF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e95f9e29-a6ae-432c-aa61-95244c18d772","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://speakerdeck.com/hiroki_hasegawa/domeinqu-dong-she-ji-toyi-cun-xing-ni-zhuan-falseyuan-ze?slide=24\u003e\nさすがにちょっと、関係なさすぎだなw","ts":"1628475928.099800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Speaker Deck: ドメイン駆動設計と依存性逆転の原則","id":1,"title":"ドメイン駆動設計と依存性逆転の原則","title_link":"https://speakerdeck.com/hiroki_hasegawa/domeinqu-dong-she-ji-toyi-cun-xing-ni-zhuan-falseyuan-ze?slide=24","text":"社内エンジニアの方々に，ドメイン駆動設計と依存性逆転の原則について布教しようと試みましたʕ◔ϖ◔ʔ 個人リポジトリ： \u003chttps://github.com/hiroki-it\u003e プロフィール： \u003chttps://www.wantedly.com/id/h_hasegawa\u003e","image_url":"https://files.speakerdeck.com/presentations/509d25f8592f4177a4486c1be893f70c/slide_0.jpg?18730671","blocks":null,"service_name":"Speaker Deck","service_icon":"https://d1eu30co0ohy4w.cloudfront.net/assets/favicon-c0fe5475f88a65b817c8cc7c0fedc01b7acc17fe27628fa13ca3f96e56e16977.png","from_url":"https://speakerdeck.com/hiroki_hasegawa/domeinqu-dong-she-ji-toyi-cun-xing-ni-zhuan-falseyuan-ze?slide=24","original_url":"https://speakerdeck.com/hiroki_hasegawa/domeinqu-dong-she-ji-toyi-cun-xing-ni-zhuan-falseyuan-ze?slide=24"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jNYW"}]}]
